  "transformations": [
    "Flattened per-group storage into contiguous xs, ys, and labels arrays in a Dataset struct with dynamic reallocation during parsing.",
    "Parallelized distance computation over all points using OpenMP static scheduling; each thread maintains its own max-heap of size k.",
    "Vectorized squared Euclidean distance calculation for batches of four points using ARM NEON intrinsics (vld1q_f32, vdupq_n_f32).",
    "Used a (distance, global index) comparator in the heap and final merge to exactly reproduce reference tie-breaking behavior.",
    "Replaced insertion-sort/qsort frequency logic with direct character-frequency counting over 256 possible labels."
  ]
